{
  "$comment": "Registry of KeenMate web components. Source for the README catalogue (`npm run readme`) and the authority for port allocation (`kmwc doctor` cross-checks each component's package.json#kmwc.ports against it). Ports: each component owns a block of 100 — dev = block, preview = block + 1, image = block + 10. `note` is shown when the package has no description; `portNote` records reassigned ports until the repo migrates. `prefix` mirrors the reserved-prefix table in BlissFramework guidelines/web-components/base-variables.md (the authority) — kmwc new refuses any prefix listed here or there.",
